<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Though we in sin and wickedness</l><l>Went far from Thee apace,</l><l>Yet in the Son Thou didst redeem,</l><l>Bestowing life and grace.</l><l>Though we have often slighted Thee,</l><l>Thy Spirit often grieved,</l><l>Yet Thou dost still as Spirit come</l><l>As life to be received.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
